  "translation": "This weekend, my mother and I went to the mall together to buy clothes. There were many people in the mall; we first looked at skirts. Mom liked that red skirt, but I thought this blue one was very beautiful. Mom said: 'Do you like red or blue?' I said: 'Blue.' We tried the blue skirt, and it was very suitable. Then we went to look at shoes. I bought a pair of white shoes, and Mom bought a hat. We also ate ice cream in the mall. Finally, we came out of the mall and took the bus home. Today was really happy!"
